 "introduction_text": "<div class=\"ql-editor read-mode\"><p><strong>Matt Expense Tracker</strong></p><p><br></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Date</strong> - date of the receipt, invoice, or cash ledger.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Money In</strong> - ONLY fill this out if you collected money.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Money Out</strong> - ONLY fill this out if you spent money.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Company </strong>- MTPZ (greenhouse), Motley Terpz (extracts, branding, etc), or TSBC (outdoor farm). </li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Receipt</strong> - upload the receipt, cash form, etc or any reference attachment.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Notes</strong> - add any additional notes here</li></ol><p><br></p></div>",
